6,Polar Interrogative Strategies in Obolo | Springer Nature Link,https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-981-19-2932-8_12,"This study provides a description of polar interrogatives, discusses the different strategies the Obolo (Niger-Congo) language employs to derive these interrogatives the different positions polar interrogative markers occupy in the language.",Obolo,Niger-Congo
7,"My Kemetic Dreams, mell0ne: The Obolo People are an ethnic group...",https://kemetic-dreams.tumblr.com/post/666596052784267264/the-obolo-people-are-an-ethnic-group-in-nigeria,"Obolo is a Lower Cross River language of the Niger–Congo language family. The Andoni people are the fiercest warriors in the Niger Delta, they have fought many wars with the Ogonis yet the two communities remained friends.",Obolo,Niger-Congo
